WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.986
A reference parameter aliases its caller’s variable.

00:00:03.986 --> 00:00:09.680
Assignments therefore change the original objects, unlike ordinary pass-by-value parameters.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:14.666
